Url": "https://twitter.com/cryptovizart/status/2092657317338620118", "text": "I am cautious, and objective\nObjectively speaking, market is experiencing a nice capital inflow. \n This move was not abnormal up to 68k-70k, retesting the short-term holder cost basis. \n\nMy main concern is the rally from 70k to 81k, which in my opinion was a short squeeze ( perpetual forced buy) driven leg up. \n\nWe need spot demand to catch up here, otherwise we can\u2019t hold the ground for long. \n\nAll in all, as far as short-term holder\u2019s costs basis is not failed, we have a good chance to fully transit to bull in coming months.", "source": "Twitter for iPhone", "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "likeCount": 7, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 375, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 26 16:55:58 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 2, "isReply": true, "inReplyToId": "2092053311142715880", "conversationId": "2092053311142715880", "media": [], "inReplyToUserId": "781268059189284868", "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "cryptovizart", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart", "id": "1364454278866366464", "name": "cryptovizart", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077448140102250496/TO7xrl5V_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1364454278866366464/1772574793", "description": "Bitcoin fixed my time preference\nLead Research Analyst @glassnode\nAI does the typing, I do the thinking", "location": "UTXO", "followers": 43768, "following": 454, "createdAt": "Wed Feb 24 05:57:16 +0000 2021", "canDm": true}, "quoted_tweet": null, "retweeted_tweet": null}, {"type": "tweet", "id": "2092595730716205203", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092595730716205203", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/cryptovizart/status/2092595730716205203", "text": "https://t.co/FbKdNimq7R", "source": "Twitter for iPhone", "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "likeCount": 3, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 634, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 26 12:51:15 +0000 2026", "lang": "zxx", "bookmarkCount": 0, "isReply": true, "inReplyToId": "2092471735761125783", "conversationId": "2092470406175166599", "media": [], "inReplyToUserId": "1364454278866366464", "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "cryptovizart", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart", "id": "1364454278866366464", "name": "cryptovizart", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077448140102250496/TO7xrl5V_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1364454278866366464/1772574793", "description": "Bitcoin fixed my time preference\nLead Research Analyst @glassnode\nAI does the typing, I do the thinking", "location": "UTXO", "followers": 43768, "following": 454, "createdAt": "Wed Feb 24 05:57:16 +0000 2021", "canDm": true}, "quoted_tweet": {"id": "2092592418377830905", "text": "Futures open interest is at around $36 billion, it is 7.7% up since August 15. However, when measured in Bitcoin it fell 13.5% over the same stretch.\n\nThe dollar figure went up because Bitcoin got expensive, not because more positions were opened.\n\nFor the rally to continue, https://t.co/xaZQsFWcvr", "user": {"name": "Sean Sharif", "screen_name": "SeanSharifQuant"}}, "retweeted_tweet": null}, {"type": "tweet", "id": "2092474128238334226", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092474128238334226", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/cryptovizart/status/2092474128238334226", "text": "Monthly capital flow direction have now returned to positive territory.\n\nFrom here, staying clear of a return to the bear market depends on demand stepping in to buy the dip and stabilizing price above the Short-Term Holder Cost Basis, now near $70k.\n\nThat is the key line to defend.", "source": "Twitter Web App", "retweetCount": 3, "replyCount": 1, "likeCount": 38, "quoteCount": 2, "viewCount": 15844, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 26 04:48:03 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 1, "isReply": false, "inReplyToId": null, "conversationId": "2092474128238334226", "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQn1eNeX0AAj44M.jpg", "expanded_url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092474128238334226/photo/1", "video_url": null}], "inReplyToUserId": null, "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "cryptovizart", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart", "id": "1364454278866366464", "name": "cryptovizart", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077448140102250496/TO7xrl5V_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1364454278866366464/1772574793", "description": "Bitcoin fixed my time preference\nLead Research Analyst @glassnode\nAI does the typing, I do the thinking", "location": "UTXO", "followers": 43768, "following": 454, "createdAt": "Wed Feb 24 05:57:16 +0000 2021", "canDm": true}, "quoted_tweet": {"id": "2088958972644487492", "text": "On a monthly basis, the Bitcoin market is still bleeding.\n\nThe 30D change in Realized Cap sits at -0.3%, meaning that over the past month, aggregate capital flow into Bitcoin has been net negative. More value has left the market than entered it.\n\nShort-term price recovery does https://t.co/sP5svrg2qH", "user": {"name": "cryptovizart", "screen_name": "cryptovizart"}}, "retweeted_tweet": null}, {"type": "tweet", "id": "2092471735761125783", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092471735761125783", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/cryptovizart/status/2092471735761125783", "text": "Among perpetual exchanges, Hyperliquid was hit especially hard.\n\nIts OI surged from 34k BTC to 45k BTC, a ~32% increase (high leverage shorts were stacking up), before giving back essentially the entire build-up during the liquidation event ( short squeeze).\n\nThat made Hyperliquid one of the key sources of forced buying in the rally, as crowded shorts were squeezed aggressively.\n\nAnd apparently, the lesson did not stick. Hyperliquid shorts were squeezed hard again yesterday.", "source": "Twitter Web App", "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 2, "likeCount": 12, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 1249, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 26 04:38:32 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 0, "isReply": true, "inReplyToId": "2092470409815842898", "conversationId": "2092470406175166599", "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQnz8MnXsAAhf8A.jpg", "expanded_url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092471735761125783/photo/1", "video_url": null}], "inReplyToUserId": "1364454278866366464", "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "cryptovizart", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart", "id": "1364454278866366464", "name": "cryptovizart", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077448140102250496/TO7xrl5V_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1364454278866366464/1772574793", "description": "Bitcoin fixed my time preference\nLead Research Analyst @glassnode\nAI does the typing, I do the thinking", "location": "UTXO", "followers": 43768, "following": 454, "createdAt": "Wed Feb 24 05:57:16 +0000 2021", "canDm": true}, "quoted_tweet": null, "retweeted_tweet": null}, {"type": "tweet", "id": "2092470409815842898", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092470409815842898", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/cryptovizart/status/2092470409815842898", "text": "Against the backdrop of such heavy accumulation, a rally back to the STH Cost Basis near $68k was not unusual.\n\nBut stretching that move to $80k so quickly required another force.\n\nIn my view, the perpetual short squeeze provided the fuel for the excess move from $68k to $80k.\n\nLook at the relentless growth in Open Interest ahead of the rally, even as the market remained quiet and broadly bearish. Shorts were piling in aggressively right up to Aug 19.\n\nWhat followed was one of the largest liquidation events on record, driving OI from 548k BTC to 463k BTC, a ~15.5% contraction.", "source": "Twitter Web App", "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "likeCount": 13, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 1379, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 26 04:33:16 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 0, "isReply": true, "inReplyToId": "2092470406175166599", "conversationId": "2092470406175166599", "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQnw729XcAAKpAj.jpg", "expanded_url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092470409815842898/photo/1", "video_url": null}, {"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQnyoUKWEAAEyWf.jpg", "expanded_url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092470409815842898/photo/1", "video_url": null}], "inReplyToUserId": "1364454278866366464", "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "cryptovizart", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart", "id": "1364454278866366464", "name": "cryptovizart", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077448140102250496/TO7xrl5V_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1364454278866366464/1772574793", "description": "Bitcoin fixed my time preference\nLead Research Analyst @glassnode\nAI does the typing, I do the thinking", "location": "UTXO", "followers": 43768, "following": 454, "createdAt": "Wed Feb 24 05:57:16 +0000 2021", "canDm": true}, "quoted_tweet": null, "retweeted_tweet": null}, {"type": "tweet", "id": "2092470406175166599", "url": "https://x.com/cryptovizart/status/2092470406175166599", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/cryptovizart/status/2092470406175166599", "text": "Heavy accumulation in the $63k\u2013$64k range from late July through mid-August laid the foundation for the recent rally toward $80k. https://t.co/CmtUotBzab", "source": "Twitter Web App", "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 5, "likeCount": 58, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 4722, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 26 04:33:15 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 5, "isReply": false, "inReplyToId": null, "conve